rotection evidence and all required checks. Deployment and security changes need specific approval.</p></details>\n    <p><strong>Host approval controls unavailable.</strong> Plates has no connected authenticated adapter that supplies current effective tool permissions or applies scoped host consent. Host prompts and existing command approvals remain in force.</p>\n    <button type=\"button\" disabled aria-disabled=\"true\">Host approval settings unavailable</button>\n    \n    \n  </section><p class=\"meta quota-note\">GitHub allowance: 150 requests remaining · resets 2026-10-21 17:00 UTC.</p></div><noscript><p>Live source reads and filters require JavaScript. Cached records and source links remain available above; enable JavaScript to load uncached project summaries.</p></noscript><footer>Plates keeps project records with their source. Access is checked on every request.</footer></main><footer class=\"plates-footer\" data-page-footer><button type=\"button\" class=\"theme-toggle\" data-theme-toggle aria-label=\"Theme: System. Switch to Light\">System</button><form method=\"post\" action=\"/api/auth/logout\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf\" value=\"fake-csrf-acme\"><button>Sign out</button></form></footer><script type=\"module\" src=\"/assets/navigation-client.mjs\"></script><script type=\"module\" src=\"/assets/safety-client.mjs\"></script><script type=\"module\" src=\"/assets/home-client.mjs\"></script></body></html>",
